---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/archives.css';
import { SOCIAL_LINKS, SITE_AUTHOR, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---
<Base title={`About - ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="About beabzk, a full-stack developer focused on practical software and clear systems.">
  <header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>{SITE_AUTHOR}</h1></header>
  <section class="prose about-story">
    <p>Hey, I&apos;m {SITE_AUTHOR}. I’m a student and a hobbyist. I study mechanical engineering, but I spend a lot of my free time programming. I build things to learn how they work.</p>
    <p>My background is in the physical world, but I treat code as just another tool in the toolbox. I write software to automate my routines, build utilities for things I enjoy, and fix daily annoyances. I don't claim to be an expert in either field yet, but I like solving my own problems.</p>
    <p>This site is a small record of that work: projects I&apos;ve built, notes from learning in public, and the tools I use to fix my daily annoyances.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
